My only SMP Alpha is a CS20 running DS20L firmware. I know there were iss=
ues at one time with the built-in NIC and SCSI controllers. Did those eve=
r get resolved=3F If so, I=E2=80=99ll get it racked and powered up.

I had swapped the SCSI controller out with one for a DS20L to run Tru64 o=
n it at one time, but I still have the original (if I remember correctly,=
 NetBSD didn=E2=80=99t like the DS20L one). I know one was Adaptec, I for=
get what the other one was.

-Dustin
